+/* FUNDRAISING & COMMUNITY EVENTS — ONE CALENDAR OVER TWO TABLES.
+
+   Fundraisers (funding_events) and community / outreach events (recruitment_events) used to have a calendar each,
+   on two pages. This is the one place to add and see both. NOTHING MERGES IN THE DB: the two tables stay separate,
+   this view reads both and tags every item with its kind, and the add form routes the insert by the kind toggle.
+   Every other reader of the two tables (dashboard tiles, the Station calendar, each fundraiser's Key dates,
+   my_department_rollup) still reads its own table directly — this union is local to this view on purpose.
+
+   DETAILS. start_time / end_time (time, nullable), location_label (text) and notes (text) are all optional: no time
+   reads "All day", exactly as every event did before they existed. The AI-plan import and Key dates in FundraiserHQ
